# The camera preview with the phone shaken by its own vibration motor: four
# three-second haptics while the rear camera runs, then the front, so the
# exposure's behaviour under a violent shake is in the log (few asks while the
# picture moves, and the frame rate steady) without a hand on the phone.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 10 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6 tap 0.845 0.36 wait 15
/redwood/bin/sound_test haptic 3 wait 2 haptic 3 wait 2 haptic 3 wait 2 haptic 3 wait 5
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.886 0.871 wait 15
/redwood/bin/sound_test haptic 3 wait 2 haptic 3 wait 2 haptic 3 wait 2 haptic 3 wait 5
